      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That's so weird cause in game we don't see it but it shows up on photos? There must be some kind of animation update computing delay that happens when take photo is clicked to cause this bug, should be an easy fix for the Devs just rework how VRchat takes the snapshot :HAHAHA: it's simple in theory but it might be difficult to come up with new system\n\nEither way photos are important in this game so they gonna solve it it's a priority bug I think",
