  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When taking pictures of users, in the pictures I get the impression the body mesh does not align with the other meshes. Viewing it normally does not show any anomalies.\n\nAt first (during the open beta) I thought this was just an avatar and/or physbone and/or unity error and notified the avatar creator about the issue. But now with the build going live last Friday I noticed other photographers complaining about it as well. So I have to assume this is a bug in the current VRChat build.",
